+# --- SG22: 0675 -- THE THIRD VOICE IS SILENT WHERE IT MUST BE ---------------
+# ⚠ GREEN BEFORE THE CHANGE (vacuously -- the marker does not exist yet) and it
+# must be green AFTER for a REASON, which is why it is committed: a `--nogui`
+# session has no Tk at all, so "no sink is visible" is its NORMAL condition and
+# not a fault to announce. A third voice that fired on reachability alone would
