+# `#! ` line that reddens SG14 directly above. The firing condition is
+# narrower: the live channel is NOT the bootstrap, AND Tk is live, AND no arm is
+# visible. Both farms here fail the first or the second term.
+check "SG22 0675 the third voice does NOT fire where no human sink was ever\
+ possible: a HEALTHY headless farm and a DEGRADED headless one both write ZERO\
+ `NOTICE CHANNEL UNREACHABLE` lines, to the log and to stderr alike" \
+  [list [sg_log_count $sg_clean {NOTICE CHANNEL UNREACHABLE}] \
+        [sg_out_count $sg_clean {NOTICE CHANNEL UNREACHABLE}] \
+        [sg_log_count $sg_ciw   {NOTICE CHANNEL UNREACHABLE}] \
+        [sg_out_count $sg_ciw   {NOTICE CHANNEL UNREACHABLE}]] \
+  [list 0 0 0 0]
 
